title: '? If you meet a purple M with no old title under it again, will you tell Top before you save or reopen that buffer?'
pid: 0d448661-64dd-44c4-a38e-09bfcc9b7196
body: |2-
  The server keeps only the last exchange of each view, so the next save of that
  buffer replaces the copy that would show what you saw. Closing the buffer keeps
  the copy, if you close it without saving. If you do not answer, Top will read whatever the folder holds when your
  report arrives.
